{"3979060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unmarked City", "steam_appid": 3979060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Free Demo Coming Soon</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Demo will be available soon. Wishlist now so you won't miss it!</strong></h2></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features in short:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >guns and their upgrades to shoot with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dozen cars to drive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >open city with interiors to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >live traffic and npcs to interact with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >non-linear gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deep story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >simple, sharp graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >time cycle and dynamic weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cheat codes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >save and load any time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adjustable graphic and game settings</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Working as a personal bodyguard for a local real estate developer means dealing with a new terrorist group, that targets popular businessmen in the area.</strong></i>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect your employer, you will use not only guns and explosives, but also called-in backup, robotic equipment, your old friends from police force, but most importantly - your sharp mind. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/01dce6681d68f6ea2e99441fdc2bfa96.poster.avif?t=1787143100\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/01dce6681d68f6ea2e99441fdc2bfa96.webm?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/01dce6681d68f6ea2e99441fdc2bfa96.mp4?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Exploring the city can only help you with your fight... if you give the city something back.</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting local people and solving their problems can pay you off greatly. Those funny pills from a thankful dealer will make you fly. Neighbor's <i>Cupcake</i> needs you as a dog-sitter, but will help with biting naughty people. And a quartermaster from the station can fix you that special rifle upgrade.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/40790860f2010099899edca780951f1c.poster.avif?t=1787143100\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/40790860f2010099899edca780951f1c.webm?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/40790860f2010099899edca780951f1c.mp4?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Alive world with dynamic traffic, day-night cycle, weather, and no loading screens.</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Busy center, calm suburbs, annoying road works, loud clubs, cramped apartments, roaming squirrels, airport and even a football pitch... this place has it all! No invisible barrier will block your free roam.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/0233bd4cc96003a62fb8147afbe0813a.avif?t=1787143100\" alt=\"City covered in a fog, viewed from above\" width=1560 height=569 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Focused on fun, not on unreal AAA graphics.</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmarked City is a video game, not a cinematic film that will fry your PC. With that said, the story can still engage you deeply.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/826cc4f15484c4d69e811ebfc9586c89.poster.avif?t=1787143100\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/826cc4f15484c4d69e811ebfc9586c89.webm?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/826cc4f15484c4d69e811ebfc9586c89.mp4?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>So... ready for some action? Grab your gun and keys.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And as the events unfold, you will realize that... <span class=\"bb_strike\">your perspective shifts.        </span></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Working as a personal bodyguard for a local real estate developer means dealing with a new terrorist group, that targets popular businessmen in the area.</strong></i>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect your employer, you will use not only guns and explosives, but also called-in backup, robotic equipment, your old friends from police force, but most importantly - your sharp mind. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/01dce6681d68f6ea2e99441fdc2bfa96.poster.avif?t=1787143100\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/01dce6681d68f6ea2e99441fdc2bfa96.webm?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/01dce6681d68f6ea2e99441fdc2bfa96.mp4?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Exploring the city can only help you with your fight... if you give the city something back.</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting local people and solving their problems can pay you off greatly. Those funny pills from a thankful dealer will make you fly. Neighbor's <i>Cupcake</i> needs you as a dog-sitter, but will help with biting naughty people. And a quartermaster from the station can fix you that special rifle upgrade.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/40790860f2010099899edca780951f1c.poster.avif?t=1787143100\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/40790860f2010099899edca780951f1c.webm?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/40790860f2010099899edca780951f1c.mp4?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Alive world with dynamic traffic, day-night cycle, weather, and no loading screens.</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Busy center, calm suburbs, annoying road works, loud clubs, cramped apartments, roaming squirrels, airport and even a football pitch... this place has it all! No invisible barrier will block your free roam.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/0233bd4cc96003a62fb8147afbe0813a.avif?t=1787143100\" alt=\"City covered in a fog, viewed from above\" width=1560 height=569 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Focused on fun, not on unreal AAA graphics.</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmarked City is a video game, not a cinematic film that will fry your PC. With that said, the story can still engage you deeply.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/826cc4f15484c4d69e811ebfc9586c89.poster.avif?t=1787143100\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/826cc4f15484c4d69e811ebfc9586c89.webm?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/extras/826cc4f15484c4d69e811ebfc9586c89.mp4?t=1787143100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>So... ready for some action? Grab your gun and keys.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And as the events unfold, you will realize that... <span class=\"bb_strike\">your perspective shifts.        </span></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Drop right into the middle of an urban drama, where chaos begins to reign. Shoot, drive, parkour, complete tasks and explore the streets in this top-down, non-linear, gameplay based action story. As a security officer of famous businessman, expect unexpected.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/444086bebc8e45f7761b3b983ff30ab3969ef429/header.jpg?t=1787143100", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/e980fd0fd045782fbd22ce615ecf0053f85f18e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787143100", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979060/e980fd0fd045782fbd22ce615ecf0053f85f18e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787143100", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for GLES3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["GamesLikeMF"], "publishers": ["GamesLikeMF"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description"